cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "allo-classifier: can a ligand-only model tell allosteric from orthosteric modulators?"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Sutanu"
    family-names: "Mukhopadhyay"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8243-2138"
    affiliation: "S. N. Bose National Centre for Basic Sciences, Kolkata, India"
